een\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d36\"},\"ref\":\"d36\",\"snippet\":\" ... Subsequent character parts in films were a bit offbeat to say the least, having gained some weight over time. He was also involved in extensive voice-over work.\\n\\nMarried and divorced three times, he had two children, Doug and Victoria, by first wife Susan; an adopted son, Kerry ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2002\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d38\"},\"ref\":\"d38\",\"snippet\":\" ... He was married a total of seven times, and fathered eight children.\\n\\nAfter long battles with ill health, Richard Pryor passed away on December 10th, 2005.- Vincent Schiavelli, selected in 1997 by Vanity Fair as one of the best character actors in America, had made over 120 film ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2005&ref_=nmbio\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2eae7d15b478b82106490477165e486c6103310ec3c407fd2b89428c0c0368a0\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"f25453c36644ae7e681198e091391b15cb87c4a8a4f57fe96ca4376e57f2072d\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"character married three times two children died one survives TV series\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d37\"},\"ref\":\"d37\",\"snippet\":\" ... Married three times, she has two children, Kimberley and William, from her former husband, British actor Geoffrey Horne, and one child, Michael, from the marriage to Scott Paxton. She died of brain cancer at her North Carolina home in Highlands on October 14, 2009. She was 74.- Actress ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2009&ref_=nm_ov_dth_year\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d108\"},\"ref\":\"d108\",\"snippet\":\" ... the characters drive the plot. This isn't \\\"CSI\\\" or \\\"Law and Order,\\\" where each week is a variation on the same theme. On \\\"Lost,\\\" you have a group of fascinatingly different, tragically flawed characters who must somehow learn to survive together, while at the same time trying ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0411008/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d109\"},\"ref\":\"d109\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her facility with accents and dialects enabled her to play a wide variety of characters, earning her the nickname of \\\"The Chameleon\\\". Her relationship with James Dean was chronicled in Joe Hyams's biography, \\\"The James Dean Story\\\".\\n\\nMarried and divorced three times, Arlene had three children: Adam ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2014\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d110\"},\"ref\":\"d110\",\"snippet\":\" ... and epic tale of survival that for several seasons was a seamless combination of large-scale action, close-quarters character drama and pop-political philosophy.\\n\\nThe premise would have been provocative at any time: A bitter race of robots gets the drop on humanity (with the help of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2019/arts/television/best-drama-series.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{