kipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Days_of_Our_Lives_characters_introduced_in_the_2020s\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d4\"},\"ref\":\"d4\",\"snippet\":\" ... Episodes of One Life to Live are broadcast at 1:30 p.m., following All My Children which airs at 1:00 p.m., Mondays through Thursdays.\\n\\nSee also\\n\\n* List of longest-serving soap opera actors\\n* List of One Life to Live characters\\n* List of One Life to ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Life_to_Live\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d8\"},\"ref\":\"d8\",\"snippet\":\" ... When Marland redeemed the characters of Alan on GL and Craig on ATWT he softened them too much. Craig, on ATWT, went from town scoundrel to the guy who wouldn't even tell a white lie — per a soap opera magazines criticism of/commentary on Craig's reformation ... \",\"title\":\"https://marlenadelacroix.com/2009/04/guiding-light-my-favorite-years-and-what-you-can-learn-from-yours/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d3\"},\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... One Emmy nomination with zero wins\\n\\nFulton's Lisa is an archetype of the soap opera vixen, with several marriages, divorces and spousal deaths. In the earliest years of the medium, Lisa became one of the most popular characters on daytime television, and Fulton became the first soap ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/best-daytime-actresses-ever-ranked/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"283ed77c294f3bf247aa8822c7de3ec679d7f7ccd59c24fae80ce9b2802e569c\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"3d73084e3cfdc8ef596b1b6afaf03cfad90c1d772635e62e580dda109bd13e6e\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"soap opera character three marriages children died one alive\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_31ff6cc0d78b4026938c445f"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d111\"},\"ref\":\"d111\",\"snippet\":\" ... interesting kids programming that was maybe a little more \\\"grown up.\\\" Aaahh!!! Real Monsters didn't sugar coat its premise or characters, offering up a seriously odd and gross addition to the 90s animated TV show lineup—and it was positively delightful. You can't say the name ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/best-90s-cartoons/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the world of The 100.\\n\\nJessica plays Niylah, a character who shows up in the third season and has been with Clarke on a couple of different occasions. Richard played John Murphy ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d112\"},\"ref\":\"d112\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2024-12-12\\n---\\nAnyone could be forgiven for struggling to remember which TV shows aired in 2024. Whereas 2023 gave audiences the final chapters of several beloved shows—Succession, Barry, Reservation Dogs—this year may have reminded them that Hollywood is still playing catch-up after the end ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.theatlantic.com/culture/archive/2024/12/best-tv-shows-2024-hacks-shogun-industry/680850/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... It was adapted from the play of the same name from 1965, which also got a film in 1968 starring Jack Lemmon and Walter Matthau)\\n\\nAnswer: The Odd Couple - A real-life dog, who appeared in numerous films in the 1920's and 1930's, gave its name ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.watercoolertrivia.com/trivia-questions/classic-tv-trivia-questions\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d113\"},\"ref\":\"d113\",\"snippet\":\" ... movie follows fading TV hero Rick Dalton (Leonardo DiCaprio) and his best friend/stunt double Cliff Booth (Brad Pitt) as they navigate the changing landscape of Hollywood while also living next door to Sharon Tate (Margot Robbie).\\n\\nOlyphant plays one of several real-life characters in Once Upon ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/timothy-olyphant-best-movies-tv-shows/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"7afc4fc6b60f2bd352b3832bbcc7828cca9d47d3cc14bbb6d1476e42eb59eb76\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"3d3c1e17b1d748cb4521f810b19a02810153237e6cf94648898757ded5932954\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"real life couple play unrelated characters same TV show\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d114\"},\"ref\":\"d114\",\"snippet\":\" ... Before meeting Edward, Melody had been married twice before.\\n\\nThe couple notably received Lifetime Achievement Awards at the 51st Annual Daytime Emmy Awards in 2024.\\n\\nJoshua Morrow Nick Newman's love life has always been complicated, but the same can't be said for Joshua Morrow . The actor ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.swooon.com/gallery/young-and-the-restless-stars-real-life-relationships-couples-dating-history/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d115\"},\"ref\":\"d115\",\"snippet\":\" ... an inventive series of horror movies directed by Krasinski, and starring the pair as a married couple in a post-alien invasion version of Earth. Both actors also had roles in IF, another (more family friendly) film by Krasinski, although Blunt simply voiced a character instead of appearing ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/real-life-actor-couples-multiple-movies/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d116\"},\"ref\":\"d116\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 1991, Pesci earned an Oscar for Best Supporting Actor for his portrayal of real-life gangster Tommy DeVito in Goodfellas and two additional nominations in the same category for Raging Bull (1980) and The Irishman. Apart from acting, Pesci has dappled in music, having released three studio ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d117\"},\"ref\":\"d117\",\"snippet\":\" ... as Abby Winbury\\n\\nAbout the Character\\n\\nSister-in-law to the groom. Abby's married to Thomas. The couple are about to welcome their first child together.\\n\\nFanning had previously worked with Bier on The First Lady, playing Susan Elizabeth Ford. The actor and director became quite close ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/the-perfect-couple-cast-guide\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d118\"},\"ref\":\"d118\",\"snippet\":\" ... he's off to bed with the married character played by Michelle Pfeiffer. Life imitated art, as Malkovich and Pfeiffer had a real-life affair that sabotaged his marriage to actress Glenne Headly.\\n\\n\\\"Planet of the Apes\\\"\\n\\nYear released: 2001\\n\\nCouple that split: Helena Bonham Carter & Kenneth Branagh ... \",\"title\":\"https://familyminded.com/s/movies-ended-divorce-celebrity-couples-910fccfeff094145\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"251ae29c9d5faac93a939912e0321f0a5be589d2edfca1cfac6aa491d7676352\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"7f67d656fda27c2230b2937e2fa54c477a933f6f1c7c53690fc605e6b73a472e\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actors married real life play different characters same series not couple\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... Vega's husband Carlos Pena Jr. is currently starring in Life Sentence, a new CW show that just premiered this year. The two actors aren't on the same show, and they weren't even on the network at the same time, but it's nevertheless true that ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d119\"},\"ref\":\"d119\",\"snippe