:\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/feature/yellowstone-character-guide-dutton-family-tree-1235593911/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d147\"},\"ref\":\"d147\",\"snippet\":\" ... Raised in Billings; lives part-time in Big Timber | Sportscaster; host of The NFL Today (1975–1989) | |\\n| | 1975–present | Born in Helena; attended college and graduated from University of Montana | Technology journalist; host of CNET's video series Always On with CNET TV | None |\\n\\nMilitary\\n\\nPrior to statehood ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_people_from_Montana\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"bf30fb433925dbf596a50556b158a2155b06dc629742b50f93bb541113b271f6\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"b5d7c186977955145db96cf62d7a752b98221ae970118855d9db81c538cb7915\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Yellowstone TV series character married three times children died\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... attempting to raise another generation of Dutton.\\\" Yellowstone viewers will recall a flashback in season four, which introduced James and Margaret, as well as a young John and Spencer, when James was shot (that scene served as real-life couple McGraw and Hill's audition, giving Sheridan the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/feature/yellowstone-character-guide-dutton-family-tree-1235593911/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d145\"},\"ref\":\"d145\",\"snippet\":\" ... While he never appeared in any of his father's projects, Christopher did co-write the screenplay for the 2021 TV movie Highway to Heaven, inspired by his father's show.\\n\\nJennifer stars on Yellowstone\\n\\nJennifer, who often goes by Jen, played the pink-haired Teeter in seasons ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/all-about-michael-landon-kids-8364607\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... are siblings in real life are commonly cast to play siblings on television. After all, that's the best way to make it seem like the relationship is an authentic one. In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d148\"},\"ref\":\"d148\",\"snippet\":\" ... of a star-studded cast.\\n\\nSetting the Scene\\n\\nYellowstone's vivid portrayal of Montana's landscapes and ranching culture forms the backdrop for its intense power struggles. The show's carefully chosen filming locations and attention to detail create an authentic representation of rural life in the American ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.factualamerica.com/yellowstone/yellowstones-portrayal-of-power-dynamics-in-rural-montana\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d149\"},\"ref\":\"d149\",\"snippet\":\" ... This is normal life-on-the–ranch stuff, and it all ended up in Yellowstone (actor Jefferson White, who plays Jimmy, got the stallion honors).\\n\\nThen, a couple of months later, a turn of fate: Marion died and Sheridan received a call from the estate. The ranch was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/tv/tv-features/taylor-sheridan-yellowstone-interview-1235519261/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"e3750a5550fb405322a9b4caba423863f8be0d2312769f0cddaed30f4eba01bc\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"ab4ead3d005503c42edaabef2a820b00a7eb380b23b68c0ebfda0bf189b50ce8\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Yellowstone cast real life couple siblings co-stars unrelated characters\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... John Sr., who did not have any children with wife Emma (Marley Shelton), suffers an untimely death early on in 1923, pivoting the series to focus on Spencer and setting him up to be the Dutton to take over the Yellowstone ranch from an ailing Jacob. Season one ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/feature/yellowstone-character-guide-dutton-family-tree-1235593911/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d150\"},\"ref\":\"d150\",\"snippet\":\" ... Jack Dutton and his uncle, Spencer Dutton.\\n\\nJack's father (Spencer's brother) John Dutton died early in Season 1, and Jacob and Cara (Harrison Ford and Helen Mirren) have never had children. For awhile it looked like the young man was a good bet for this baby ... \",\"title\":\"https://tasteofcountry.com/1923-ending-season-2-episode-1-breakdown-dutton-rules/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d151\"},\"ref\":\"d151\",\"snippet\":\" ... Kayce Dutton\\ndate: 1997-01-01\\n---\\nKayce John Dutton is a main character on Yellowstone. He is John and Evelyn Dutton's youngest son. He had a complex and tense relationship with his father, who increasingly regretted the emotional distance between them. Kayce is married to Monica and ... \",\"title\":\"https://yellowstone.fandom.com/wiki/Kayce_Dutton\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d26\"},\"ref\":\"d26\",\"snippet\":\" ... I have to.' \\\"\\n\\nJames Badge Dale as John Dutton Sr.\\n\\nJames Badge Dale plays rugged cowboy John Dutton Sr., but in real life, he has a Hollywood pedigree.\\n\\nThe son of director and choreographer Grover Dale and late actress and singer Anita Morris, Dale was born in New ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/1923-cast-yellowstone-spinoff-actors-everything-to-know-7506240\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d148\"},\"ref\":\"d148\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Dutton Family Saga\\n\\nThe Dutton family's complex relationships and power struggles drive the narrative of Yellowstone. Their legacy spans generations, shaping the landscape of rural Montana and the series' core conflicts.\\n\\nPatriarch John Dutton\\n\\nJohn Dutton stands as the formidable head of the Dutton clan. He ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.factualamerica.com/yellowstone/yellowstones-portrayal-of-power-dynamics-in-rural-montana\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"e9a9fe1bfbc34a69da7151c06ef0a866320b9aea2a6a6ca88aa3c50c7e45bb45\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"e0b555204802d074797a901bcda99f58a2ebc1594cf96d618c25b909cf9da320\",\"sema